# One line ending in the repository. Git normalizes text files on commit, so a
# clone on Windows cannot rewrite the Swift and JavaScript tree.
* text=auto

# These files run through a POSIX shell, or start with a shebang. Both need LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf

# The release scripts compare these files line by line, so a CRLF would read as
# dependency drift.
*.lock text eol=lf
Package.resolved text eol=lf

# Keep the icon sources out of the normalizer.
*.png binary
